<title>FRANCE: French April raw steel output up 13.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>French April raw steel output up 13.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>French raw steel output totalled 1.708 million tonnes in April, up 13.9 percent from the same month a year earlier, figures released by the French steel federation showed.</p>
<p>For the first four months of 1997, steel output totalled 6.401 million tonnes, a rise of 12.2 percent over the corresponding year-earlier period.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
